    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there isn't a version of me that exists without the career. i look in the mirror and i dont see a person, i just see the wreckage of what happened. everyone expects you to \"bounce back\" or \"find a new path,\" but how do you do that when the person who was capable of those things doesn't even exist anymore? it feels like the world has already moved on and left me behind in the dark.",
